      "name": "Spew Pollution",
      "actions": 2,
      "category": "offensive",
      "traits": [
        "divine"
      ],
      "text": "The miastrilek disgorges a spray of acid and rubble in a 30-foot cone, dealing 6d6 piercing and 6d6 acid damage (DC 30 basic Reflex save save). The area becomes hazardous terrain for 1 minute (2d6 acid damage). A creature can take this damage only once per turn. The miastrilek must wait 1d4 rounds before Spewing Pollution again."
